# 📘 Voicemod Overview (April 2025)

## 🧠 Company Profile

- **Name**: Voicemod
- **Founded**: Spain
- **CEO & Co-founder**: Jaime Bosch
- **Team Size**: ~90 employees
- **User Base**: Over 4 million users globally
- **Core Mission**: Enhance digital communication through real-time voice transformation, adding expressive layers to audio interactions with sound effects, akin to how emojis enrich text conversations.


## Summary

> Voicemod is a software that provides users with innovative voice modulation technology, including voice changers, soundboards, and AI voice tools. It caters to gamers, content creators, and anyone interested in enhancing their audio experience during streaming, gaming, or video calls. The site offers various resources, tutorials, and guides to help users make the most of their voice modulation and sound customization needs.

## 🎤 Key Features

- **Voice Library**: Offers over 210 AI-generated voice filters. [Explore the collection](https://www.voicemod.net/en/voice-changer/)

- **Custom Voice Creation**: Users can craft personalized voices using built-in tools. [Learn more about VoiceLab](https://www.voicemod.net/en/voicelab/)

- **Real-Time Processing**: Utilizes AI models that operate within 40–60 milliseconds, ensuring seamless voice modulation during live conversations. [Details on AI voices](https://www.voicemod.net/en/ai-voices/)

- **Soundboard Integration**: Includes a customizable soundboard for adding sound effects and audio clips. [Access the Soundboard](https://www.voicemod.net/en/soundboard/)

- **Platform Compatibility**: Available on Windows, macOS, iOS, Android, and gaming consoles via the Voicemod Key.

## 🛡️ Ethical AI & Security Measures

- **Fairly Trained Certification**: Ensures AI models are trained exclusively on licensed or consented data.

- **Audio Watermarking**: Implements inaudible markers in synthetic voices to trace and verify authenticity.

## 🎮 Voicemod Key: Hardware Expansion - [Voicemod Key](https://www.voicemod.net/en/vmkey/)

- **Purpose**: Extends Voicemod's capabilities to gaming consoles like Xbox, PlayStation, and Nintendo Switch.

- **Functionality**: A USB-C dongle that connects to a smartphone or tablet, interfacing between the console and wired gaming headsets.

- **Compatibility**: Supports iOS 16+ and Android 8.1+.

- **Availability**: Initially launched in the U.S. but expanding it globally.

- **Pricing**: $25 for existing Pro subscribers; $39 bundled with an annual subscription for new users.

## 🌍 User Demographics & Use Cases

- **Primary Audience**: Gamers seeking immersive and expressive in-game communication.

- **Expanding Reach**: Increasing adoption among streamers, content creators, and virtual event hosts.

- **Creative Expression**: Facilitates unique character voices and interactive audio experiences in various digital settings.

